"""Meaningful detail bodies for the v1 knowledge-base strategies (the "What helps" list).

The source knowledge base (knowledge_base_v1.py) lists each strategy as a single bullet phrase,
so the verbatim transcription carried title == body. This module supplies a distinct, practical,
NON-CLINICAL body for each unique strategy phrase: the expandable detail shown under the strategy
in a preparation plan. Bodies are validated by the loader's non-clinical guard
(app/engines/alerts/guard, the shared prohibited-word list) at load.

Keys are the verbatim strategy phrases. _strats() in knowledge_base_v1 looks the body up here and
falls back to the phrase itself when a phrase is absent, so coverage degrades gracefully. Generated
by tools (research-written), then verified for coverage and the non-clinical guard before commit.
"""

